      "title": "H3 Ref2VA - Follow guide video (fixed prompt)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the same adult anime character shown in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, and <Picture 3>. Preserve the identity and outfit from <Picture 1>.\n<Video 1> is the motion and camera reference generated by the 3D Camera Guide node.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Create a 2D anime video of <Subject 1> following the motion of <Video 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\nUse the pictures for the character's appearance. Use <Video 1> for camera movement, viewing angles, framing, subject pose and movement, and timing. Replace the mannequin with <Subject 1>; do not copy its mannequin appearance.\n\ndetailed_description:\nFollow the camera and subject motion in <Video 1> throughout the video. Match its changes in viewpoint, composition, distance and motion timing. Render <Subject 1> in clean 2D anime style on a simple neutral floor and background. Do not show camera rigs, paths, grids, axes, labels or UI.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet room tone. No speech.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.",
